{
  "narrative_summary": "Rebuild In House produced the best outcome in 58% of runs of this model, and Extend Vendor Contract produced the best outcome in 42% of runs. The link from Engineering Capacity to Total Cost of Ownership is not yet evidence-backed, so this could shift.",
